  - 'Not built yet. Here will be The fisher of islands''s bough on the Chain Sickle''s Way, the weapon tree: taking Water from its god opens it and gives The Fisher''s Jawbone (the bone hook). Neither the weapon nor its moves are made yet. The fisher of islands is not built yet either. The Way arrives in phase 5 of the playtest.'
